abstract: "Research documentation for ThreatVision, a malware-triage system whose technical architecture, implementation, and integrations were independently developed by Ahsan Ali Salamat. Includes a limited post-submission diagnostic pilot; it does not report a malware-detection benchmark or validated performance."
